      "text": "The equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mfrac></math>&nbsp;has at least one solution in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>",
